{"asset_key":"timeline/dialoguetree_story_10105140","episode":"timeline","category":"dialoguetree_story","story_id":"10105140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:4:1010514001:0":{"text":"感谢诸位贵宾今日拨冗光临敝庄，在下弗朗茨。","source_cn":"感谢诸位贵宾今日拨冗光临敝庄，在下弗朗茨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4806B0671CC9D24C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010514002:0":{"text":"想必诸位都看见了，\n唯有这方水土才能养育的独特葡萄——藤水晶！","source_cn":"想必诸位都看见了，\\n唯有这方水土才能养育的独特葡萄—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21F01839D9833912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010514003:0":{"text":"现在，请允许我为诸位呈上今夜的珍宝！没错，正是由藤水晶精心制成的饮品！","source_cn":"现在，请允许我为诸位呈上今夜的珍宝！没错，正是由藤水晶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD084FA5BCFDA95E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010514004:0":{"text":"今夜，参加黄金晚宴的诸位都将品尝到它。","source_cn":"今夜，参加黄金晚宴的诸位都将品尝到它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2388349DB8CF9AEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010514005:0":{"text":"按照现在的产量，我们每年可以生产两万桶，足以供应王都所有贵族！","source_cn":"按照现在的产量，我们每年可以生产两万桶，足以供应王都所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38A59F77D4C350B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":